						8 \8 🏍️ ~h/2
						9 \9 🏎️ ~5m
						A \A 🚅 ~2m
						B \B 🚁 ~m/2
						C \C 🛩️ ~2s
						D \D ✈️ ~s/2
						E \E 🚀 ~50ms
						F \F 🛸 ~1ms
